  "faqSoundQ": "I can't hear music or sound effects",
  "faqSoundA": "Make sure Music and Sound effects are on above, and that your phone volume is up and not on silent. On the map and in battle, the speaker button mutes everything.",
  "faqProgressQ": "How do I keep my progress if I change phones?",
  "faqProgressA": "Open your Profile and tap “Save progress with Google”. On the new phone, do the same with the same account and your progress comes back.",
  "faqAdQ": "The video to revive or earn coins won't load",
  "faqAdA": "Videos need an internet connection and sometimes none are available. Wait a moment and try again. You can also use a potion to revive.",
  "faqCoinsQ": "How do I get coins and potions?",
  "faqCoinsA": "By winning levels, playing the daily mini challenges, completing quests, opening the daily chest on the home screen and watching videos in the shop.",
