  "story11Heading": "Chapter 1 complete!",
  "story11Destination": "Chapter 2 · The heart of the forest",
  "story11Narrative": "The guardian recognizes your courage and moves aside the roots blocking the path. On the other side, a blue light pulses beneath the trees: something ancient is waking up.",
  "story11Objective": "Follow the lights and discover what the forest protects.",
  "story12Heading": "Chapter 2 complete!",
  "story12Destination": "Chapter 3 · The stone gate",
  "story12Narrative": "The forest stones line up and form a portal. The map shows caverns full of crystals; there lies the clue to the power awakening in the worlds.",
  "story12Objective": "Cross the portal and look for the sign of the next world.",
  "story13Heading": "Forest protected!",
  "story13Destination": "World 2 · The Caverns",
  "story13Narrative": "With the dragon defeated, the forest shines again. A stream of crystals points the way to the caverns, where a new creature guards the next fragment.",
  "story13Objective": "Explore the caverns and gather their fragments of knowledge.",
  "story21Heading": "Chapter 1 complete!",
  "story21Destination": "Chapter 2 · The echo of the crystals",
  "story21Narrative": "The guardian at the entrance stops roaring. Its echo reveals a secret tunnel and, on its walls, crystals that repeat a melody every time you solve a riddle.",
  "story21Objective": "Follow the melody to the central chamber.",
  "story22Heading": "Chapter 2 complete!",
  "story22Destination": "Chapter 3 · The underground bridge",
  "story22Narrative": "The chamber lights up and a bridge appears over the abyss. The colossus waits at the far end, but the marks on the bridge show that only careful observation will let you cross.",
  "story22Objective": "Reach the other side and get ready for the colossus.",
  "story23Heading": "Caverns conquered!",
  "story23Destination": "World 3 · The Floating Islands",
  "story23Narrative": "The colossus opens the way to the sky. The floating islands drift closer through the clouds, and a winged creature carries the next fragment to the very top.",
  "story23Objective": "Climb the islands and recover the sky fragment.",
  "story31Heading": "Chapter 1 complete!",
  "story31Destination": "Chapter 2 · The sky currents",
  "story31Narrative": "The first island rises again. A wind map appears on the ground, showing a shifting route through the clouds; you'll have to read its signs to move on.",
  "story31Objective": "Find the current that leads to the central island.",
  "story32Heading": "Chapter 2 complete!",
  "story32Destination": "Chapter 3 · The crystal storm",
  "story32Narrative": "The safe route ends before a blue storm. At its center shines the last sky fragment, guarded by the lord of the islands.",
  "story32Objective": "Cross the storm and gather the sky fragments.",
  "story33Heading": "Islands restored!",
  "story33Destination": "World 4 · The Volcano",
  "story33Narrative": "The storm fades and the islands return to their places. From up high you see a red glow: the volcano is waking up and threatens to cover every path in ash.",
  "story33Objective": "Reach the volcano before the last route disappears.",
  "story41Heading": "Chapter 1 complete!",
  "story41Destination": "Chapter 2 · The river of magma",
  "story41Narrative": "The salamander steps aside, revealing a trail between black rocks. A river of magma cuts the path; its ancient signs show when it's safe to move forward.",
  "story41Objective": "Read the signs and cross the river of magma.",
  "story42Heading": "Chapter 2 complete!",
  "story42Destination": "Chapter 3 · The heart of the volcano",
  "story42Narrative": "The river calms down and the mountain falls silent. Deep inside, the titan guards the heart of the volcano; solving its trials could stop the eruption.",
  "story42Objective": "Face the titan and protect the four worlds.",
  "story43Heading": "Adventure complete!",
  "story43Destination": "The four worlds are safe",
  "story43Narrative": "The heart of the volcano goes dark and a light sweeps across the forest, the caverns and the islands. Your answers helped gather the fragments and restore the balance.",
  "story43Objective": "Your legend is written. You can return to the worlds to improve your stars.",
